T3 schema names equal T3 example header; T8 schema names equal T8 example header.\n52: - **Atomicity spot-check**: value cells of the split rows (184/186/188/191/192/194/195/198/199/200/201/204) contain no `；`/`、` bundling.\n53: - **Date invariants**: P1/P2/P3 `T+90`, `P2`/`P3` `T+180`, `P3-Q2` earliest/latest `T+90` and latest `T+180`, and case `T+30/+60/+90/+180` all re-derived by calendar arithmetic and matched.\n54: - **Boundary invariants confirmed intact**: `0057` = `I13-E01` = official checkbox `061` remain three distinct fields clear of `062`/`063`; decisions still bound to mature `P3` only; merged rates still labelled descriptive/non-decision.\n55: \n56: ## Interpretation notes, additions beyond the enumerated minimum, and residual issues\n57: \n58: 1. **Brief wording \"§13.1 T3 field schema\"** was read as the T3 field-schema table in §7 (the reviewer's own Section B row is \"§13.1／§7 T3 欄不一致\"); §13.1 itself is the register-row schema and was left intact.\n59: 2. **`SF-0057-200` normalized** (no new ID): it bundled the T+90 record count + referral flag + the main-wave decision, the same defect class as `SF-0057-188`. Its 合成值 is now the decision only; the count/flag remain covered by `SF-0057-188`/`210` (which now also carry the §12.2 追蹤結果 T+90 locator). Content-preserving, no data change.\n60: 3. **Two extra repeated-display locators added** so T9 問題欄 displays that repeat a registered value are locatored: `SF-0057-160` gains `T9 / F3 列 / 問題欄` (`≥15 百分點`), `SF-0057-215` gains `T9 / F4 列 / 問題欄` (`18 欄`). No new IDs.\n61: 4. **Residual (not flagged by the reviewer, left untouched to stay bounded):** T9 `F1 問題欄` (\"應用率未隨達標率同步上升\") is narrative-only with no numeric synthetic value, consistent with §10.1 finding narratives not carrying their own rows; `SF-0057-193` (示範任務) and `SF-0057-197` (成功準則) each carry one compound descriptive/rule sentence rather than a category in the brief's bundle list; the T1 field schema lists `資料截點` while the T1 example table instea